    "dialog.about.body": {
        "source": "Explore stitch order, thread colors, jumps, trims, and machine commands before production. Preview the design stitch by stitch, switch rendering styles, and export what you see.",
        "translation": "Terokai susunan jahitan, warna benang, lompatan, pemangkasan, dan arahan mesin sebelum pengeluaran. Pratonton reka bentuk jahitan demi jahitan, tukar gaya pemaparan, dan eksport apa yang anda lihat."
    },
